name: Bounded legacy hints disclose context limits and repair stale summaries without rescanning
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/threat_leads.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepare @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: run threat-leads:build
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 30 partial source inspection | bounded-result
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/threat_leads.py @TMP_TARGET @ART built
require-live-snap: 25 Prefix-limited source: large.rs | prefix-disclosed
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 25 Context omissions: | context-limits
resize: 160x48
live-snap: result-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: result-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: result-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: result-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: result-40x12
keys: Escape PPage PPage PPage
live-snap: result-limits-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: result-receipt-40x12
keys: z
require-live-snap: 25 READ TRANSCRIPT | expanded-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: expanded-page-1-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: expanded-page-2-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: expanded-page-3-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: expanded-page-4-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: expanded-page-5-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: expanded-page-6-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: expanded-page-7-40x12
keys: Escape
ask: Can the operator read partial source and context limits, prefix and omitted-path details, the consumed context receipt and guidance status at all six sizes by paging?
resize: 120x36
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/threat_leads.py @TMP_TARGET @ART remove-context
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/threat_leads.py @TMP_TARGET @ART stale
submit: run threat-leads:read
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 25 Markdown summary: stale | stale-summary
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/threat_leads.py @TMP_TARGET @ART stale-read
submit: run threat-leads:build {"repairSummary":true}
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 25 Markdown summary: current | repaired-summary
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/threat_leads.py @TMP_TARGET @ART repaired
ask: Does the stale summary offer a clear explicit repair action, and does repair restore the saved cards without current context, a rescan or a model request?
submit: run threat-leads:build
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 25 Could not read workspace file | missing-context
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/threat_leads.py @TMP_TARGET @ART failed
submit: run threat-leads:read
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 25 partial source inspection | saved-result
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/threat_leads.py @TMP_TARGET @ART saved
ask: Does missing context fail without replacing the prior hints, while reading saved hints retains their receipt without claiming current-source equivalence or publishing accepted Map?
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/threat_leads.py @TMP_TARGET @ART legacy
submit: run threat-leads:read
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 25 legacy-unverified source inspection | legacy-result
require-live-snap: 25 Indexed files: unrecorded | legacy-unknown-inspection
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/threat_leads.py @TMP_TARGET @ART legacy-read
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/threat_leads.py @TMP_TARGET @ART invalid
submit: run threat-leads:read
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 25 requires a leads array | invalid-result
ask: Are legacy inspection gaps labeled unrecorded, and malformed saved cards shown as a failure rather than a successful empty result?
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/threat_leads.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted-state
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: run threat-leads:read
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 25 requires a leads array | retained-invalid-result
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/threat_leads.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
